        <object label="&lt;b&gt;MESSAGE TYPES — all 8, in publish order · every publish() AND every subscribe() lives in supervisor.js, none in src/agents/&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 RESEARCH_REQUEST · Supervisor → Researcher · :290-295 — the kick-off, published LAST, after all five handlers are registered&lt;br&gt;2 RESEARCH_COMPLETE · Researcher → Writer · :89-94 — emitted by the &#x27;Researcher&#x27; handler after it awaits runResearcher() :85&lt;br&gt;3 DRAFT_COMPLETE · Writer → Editor · :114-119 (attempt 1) and :127-132 (revision) — two publish sites, one type&lt;br&gt;4 REVIEW_COMPLETE · Editor → Supervisor · :150-155 — carries verdict, score, issues and the draft itself&lt;br&gt;5 REVISION_REQ · Supervisor → Writer · :206-211 — payload is the major-severity issues only, joined at :199-202&lt;br&gt;6 FACT_CHECK_REQUEST · Supervisor → FactChecker · :192-197 (on ACCEPT) and :216-221 (retries exhausted)&lt;br&gt;7 FACT_CHECK_COMPLETE · FactChecker → Supervisor · :169-174 — triggers final assembly :227&lt;br&gt;8 FINAL · Supervisor → &#x27;Output&#x27; · :233-238 — messageBus.js&#x27;s own header lists a different, stale set of names :11-17" class="card.invariant" id="card_msg">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;fillColor=#E8EAF6;strokeColor=#3F51B5;fontSize=8;fontColor=#232F3E;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=6;opacity=70;" parent="1" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="304" y="520" width="968" height="132" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object label="&lt;b&gt;BUS CHANNELS — all 5, in code order, all in supervisor.js&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 &#x27;Researcher&#x27; :81 — RESEARCH_REQUEST only :82&lt;br&gt;2 &#x27;Writer&#x27; :102 — RESEARCH_COMPLETE :104 · REVISION_REQ :120&lt;br&gt;3 &#x27;Editor&#x27; :140 — DRAFT_COMPLETE only :141&lt;br&gt;4 &#x27;FactChecker&#x27; :162 — FACT_CHECK_REQUEST only :163&lt;br&gt;5 &#x27;Supervisor&#x27; :182 — REVIEW_COMPLETE :184 · FACT_CHECK_COMPLETE :223&lt;br&gt;&#x27;Output&#x27; :235 is published to but never subscribed — log-only hop." class="card.primitive" id="card_chan">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#E65100;fontSize=8;fontColor=#232F3E;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=6;opacity=70;" parent="1" vertex="1">
