        <object label="&lt;b&gt;SUPERVISOR VERDICT BRANCH — complete, in code order :184-222&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 verdict === &#x27;ACCEPT&#x27; :188 → publish FACT_CHECK_REQUEST :192&lt;br&gt;2 else attempt ≤ MAX_RETRIES(2) :198 → majors :199 → REVISION_REQ :206&lt;br&gt;3 else :212 → stop revising, fact-check the best draft anyway :216&lt;br&gt;Budget gate: trackCost() :301 bills every tokenUsage; checkBudget() :305&lt;br&gt;THROWS above $2 at :308 — called 4× at :106 :144 :186 :225 → demo.js:79" class="card.failure" id="card_stop">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;fillColor=#FFEBEE;strokeColor=#C62828;fontSize=8;fontColor=#232F3E;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=6;opacity=70;" parent="1" vertex="1">
